                                    <div class="flex gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60"></span><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60"></span><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60"></span></div>
